WEBVTT

01:36.620 --> 01:43.020
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

01:43.380 --> 01:46.060
[Episode 1]

01:48.060 --> 01:54.250
[Balai, Nanyang]

02:08.610 --> 02:11.630
Please welcome the bride and groom!

02:21.500 --> 02:22.660
What's that smell?

02:23.610 --> 02:24.410
It stinks.

02:24.410 --> 02:25.470
What's that smell?

02:30.410 --> 02:33.280
This is a wedding gift from our clan.

02:50.840 --> 02:54.200
Bride and groom, bow to heaven and earth.

03:02.910 --> 03:06.720
Go there.

03:09.650 --> 03:15.840
As long as you abandon your physical body,

03:16.340 --> 03:22.430
you can get everything a mortal desires.

03:35.800 --> 03:36.430
Later,

03:36.930 --> 03:38.550
the bodies of the groom's family

03:38.550 --> 03:39.420
were found in a salt marsh

03:39.420 --> 03:40.990
deep within Nanyang.

03:41.960 --> 03:44.700
The bodies were discovered
in a very bizarre state.

03:44.700 --> 03:45.810
It was said that before they died,

03:45.810 --> 03:49.670
they had frantically been digging for
treasure buried underground.

03:53.460 --> 03:54.120
After that,

03:54.650 --> 03:56.430
countless people,
bewitched by the Evil God,

03:56.430 --> 03:57.760
lost their lives there.

03:57.990 --> 03:59.590
Some unscrupulous factions

04:00.080 --> 04:01.580
also came to explore,

04:02.020 --> 04:03.680
hoping to obtain whatever
lay hidden in the deepest part

04:03.680 --> 04:05.020
beneath the salt marsh.

04:21.079 --> 04:24.240
[Zhang Ruipu, former senior
of the Southern Archives]

04:24.270 --> 04:27.030
[Expelled and Hunted Down
for His Vile Nature]

04:27.050 --> 04:28.530
Keep digging.

04:29.070 --> 04:29.870
Boss,

04:29.890 --> 04:32.090
all our men who went down there are dead.

04:32.230 --> 04:33.960
We can't keep digging anymore.

04:38.500 --> 04:40.030
Your lives are nowhere near

04:40.540 --> 04:43.290
as valuable as what's inside.

04:45.510 --> 04:46.190
In the end,

04:46.360 --> 04:48.330
those people also vanished
into the depths of the pit.

04:48.330 --> 04:49.220
No one knows

04:49.380 --> 04:51.310
what exactly happened down there.

04:51.600 --> 04:52.640
This case

04:52.720 --> 04:53.570
also drew the attention of

04:53.570 --> 04:56.010
a secret agency dedicated to
bizarre cases—

04:56.010 --> 04:57.340
the Southern Archives.

04:57.800 --> 04:58.390
It consists of

04:58.390 --> 05:00.590
people with extraordinary abilities,

05:00.650 --> 05:02.170
specializing in handling such bizarre

05:02.170 --> 05:04.030
and dangerous mysterious cases.

05:04.430 --> 05:06.020
Dispatched to investigate this time

05:06.020 --> 05:09.070
are two young agents
with completely opposite personalities.

05:09.070 --> 05:09.830
This is also

05:09.830 --> 05:11.430
the first case they took over

05:11.590 --> 05:13.210
after being sent to Nanyang.

05:13.720 --> 05:18.290
[Nanyang Evil God Case]

05:33.420 --> 05:35.310
Recently, a large number of
mysterious deaths

05:35.310 --> 05:37.300
have occurred at the salt-alkali marshes
of Balai Yazhou—

05:37.300 --> 05:38.700
no fewer than 100 people.

05:38.710 --> 05:41.440
Before their deaths, all of them
came to this marsh

05:41.120 --> 05:43.560
[Hermit Crab Watch—Token of the Archives]

05:41.740 --> 05:43.600
searching for a mysterious cave,

05:43.610 --> 05:45.340
only to die suddenly in the end.

05:45.920 --> 05:46.530
Legend has it that the incidents

05:46.530 --> 05:48.960
were caused by a Balai Ancient God
that can speak.

05:46.690 --> 05:49.530
[Shrine of the Evil God]

05:50.880 --> 05:52.340
This should be it.

05:54.330 --> 05:55.570
The Archives instructed us

05:55.570 --> 05:57.700
to figure out what this thing really is

05:57.720 --> 06:00.180
to prevent more deaths
from happening here.

06:01.370 --> 06:02.860
Are you listening to me?

06:02.880 --> 06:03.710
Zhang Hailou?

06:07.450 --> 06:08.720
Zhang Hailou?

06:13.550 --> 06:16.880
[Zhang Hailou—Probationary Agent,
the Southern Archives]

06:16.910 --> 06:18.540
[Nickname: Zhang Salty
Notable Ability: Blade-Spitting]

06:19.080 --> 06:22.240
[Zhang Haixia—Probationary Agent,
the Southern Archives]

06:22.270 --> 06:24.300
[Nickname: Zhang Shrimpie
Notable Ability: Extraordinary Sense of Smell]

06:35.380 --> 06:36.950
No one smokes here.

06:37.930 --> 06:38.550
No.

06:38.770 --> 06:40.100
Before we go down later,

06:40.480 --> 06:42.480
I need a couple of puffs to wake me up.

06:44.030 --> 06:45.290
Keep your eyes peeled.

06:46.330 --> 06:47.960
I heard this Balai Ancient God

06:47.960 --> 06:49.890
is very good at bewitching people.

06:50.640 --> 06:51.790
Those who died

06:51.990 --> 06:53.120
came from all walks of life,

06:53.120 --> 06:55.580
but the only thing they had in common
was that

06:55.780 --> 06:58.470
they had all had contact with
this Balai Ancient God.

06:58.470 --> 06:59.510
Within 3 days,

06:59.800 --> 07:01.770
they'd inevitably come here
to dig the cave,

07:01.770 --> 07:04.030
and every one of them died a tragic death.

07:04.780 --> 07:07.310
So far, there hasn't been
a single exception.

07:09.770 --> 07:11.400
So while we investigate the case,

07:11.400 --> 07:13.000
we must be extremely careful

07:13.980 --> 07:16.110
and must not come into contact with it.

07:19.040 --> 07:20.520
Do you think if we

07:20.850 --> 07:23.040
solve this bizzare Evil God Case,

07:23.380 --> 07:25.240
we can become regular employees?

07:27.470 --> 07:28.800
I think something must be off

07:28.800 --> 07:30.060
with that Zhang Ruipu.

07:30.190 --> 07:31.140
He must have been

07:32.120 --> 07:33.370
playing tricks.

07:34.470 --> 07:36.159
As long as we catch him,

07:36.520 --> 07:38.450
we should be able to close the case.

07:53.280 --> 07:54.680
You're so powerful, huh?

07:55.290 --> 07:56.550
I can't touch you, huh?

08:02.320 --> 08:03.460
Zhang Hailou!

08:06.030 --> 08:07.170
Put it down!

08:08.660 --> 08:11.790
It looks a bit fierce, so I just wanted to
cheer it up a bit.

08:12.800 --> 08:15.130
The Archives sent us here to investigate,

08:15.460 --> 08:16.520
not to fool around.

08:17.940 --> 08:19.740
Hurry up and get back to digging.

08:27.500 --> 08:29.760
I've been digging this passage for ages.

08:30.140 --> 08:32.400
Are you sure this is the right direction?

08:35.419 --> 08:36.350
I've done the calculations.

08:36.350 --> 08:38.299
Dig a few more meters in this direction,

08:38.299 --> 08:39.840
and we can break through this passage

08:39.840 --> 08:41.570
to reach that mysterious cave.

08:46.440 --> 08:48.090
What's that you're using?

08:49.810 --> 08:50.970
This thing works amazingly well.

08:50.970 --> 08:52.100
Want to give it a try?

08:56.200 --> 08:58.250
The gods of Nanyang are all very evil.

08:58.250 --> 08:59.780
Get that thing away from me.

09:01.150 --> 09:02.750
You're that superstitious?

09:03.280 --> 09:04.900
Got it, you're not superstitious.

09:04.900 --> 09:07.960
Just don't make me clean up your mess
every single time.

09:08.080 --> 09:09.880
I clean up my own mess every time.

09:10.080 --> 09:11.430
Your nose is seriously freakish.

09:11.430 --> 09:15.030
Eating a durian at home is basically
a capital offense with you around.

09:15.030 --> 09:15.830
Zhang Haixia.

09:16.320 --> 09:17.030
How about this?

09:17.030 --> 09:18.650
Why don't you just smash your nose
somewhere and break it already?

09:18.650 --> 09:20.650
It'd save both of us
from torturing each other in the future.

09:20.650 --> 09:21.650
What do you think?

09:29.750 --> 09:31.810
See, it works amazingly well, right?

09:33.380 --> 09:34.080
Let's go.

09:39.110 --> 09:40.350
So much treasure.

09:41.510 --> 09:43.640
Zhang Ruipu must be after this, right?

09:43.970 --> 09:45.700
It's probably not that simple.

09:52.780 --> 09:53.540
Which way?

09:58.890 --> 10:00.290
There's a smell of blood.

10:00.420 --> 10:01.570
Three died just now,

10:02.100 --> 10:03.300
and 2 are still alive.

10:03.750 --> 10:05.480
They were heading deeper down.

10:25.650 --> 10:28.110
The air and muddy water here
are both highly toxic.

10:28.110 --> 10:30.150
[Zhili Pill—A Secret
Detoxifying Remedy of the Zhang Family]

10:28.370 --> 10:29.620
Let's finish this quickly

10:29.620 --> 10:30.820
and not stay too long.

10:40.950 --> 10:42.550
There's an opening up ahead.

10:42.750 --> 10:44.880
Those two went in there 10 minutes ago.

10:47.060 --> 10:50.060
This is the one time
your nose actually comes in handy.

10:54.560 --> 10:55.320
Strange.

10:55.830 --> 10:58.090
Apart from the smell of those two people,

10:58.420 --> 11:00.750
why is there such a heavy smell
of corpses?

11:01.680 --> 11:02.970
Let's go inside and take a look.

11:02.970 --> 11:04.370
We might find some clues.

11:56.530 --> 11:58.770
This thing is kind of interesting.

12:06.950 --> 12:08.040
These murals

12:08.680 --> 12:10.950
must be about the legend of
the Balai Ancient God,

12:10.950 --> 12:12.760
as known as Evil God.

12:14.100 --> 12:17.100
The greedy ancestors wanted to
obtain its treasures,

12:17.160 --> 12:19.400
so they built an ancestral shrine for it,

12:19.400 --> 12:21.280
to please it and worship it.

12:22.060 --> 12:24.570
But the Evil God took advantage of
people's greed,

12:24.570 --> 12:26.350
turning its believers into puppets

12:26.350 --> 12:27.800
to guard its treasures.

12:29.050 --> 12:30.840
So whenever intruders break in,

12:30.840 --> 12:32.960
these puppets will kill them.

12:33.620 --> 12:36.560
And after death, the victims
are also turned into puppets,

12:36.560 --> 12:38.360
becoming slaves of the Evil God.

12:45.990 --> 12:46.990
Such a boring legend.

12:46.990 --> 12:49.110
It sounds like something made up
just to scare people

12:49.110 --> 12:49.820
In this world,

12:49.820 --> 12:51.440
how could there possibly be
something

12:51.440 --> 12:53.240
as absurd as murderous puppets?

13:05.920 --> 13:07.950
Did they just look at me?

13:34.420 --> 13:36.150
Why are they only staring at me?

13:36.400 --> 13:36.890
They

13:36.980 --> 13:38.240
don't even look at you.

13:42.060 --> 13:43.380
This thing works amazingly well.

13:43.380 --> 13:44.510
Want to give it a try?

14:06.120 --> 14:06.980
Goddamn.

14:07.010 --> 14:08.470
Is it really that bizarre?

14:23.900 --> 14:25.270
Quite impressive.

14:25.300 --> 14:26.780
How did that work?

14:27.660 --> 14:28.900
Very Nanyang style.

14:31.180 --> 14:32.120
Zhang Hailou.

14:33.830 --> 14:35.510
This kind of ancestral shrine
is very rare.

14:35.510 --> 14:36.990
The things inside the niches
are even more dangerous.

14:36.990 --> 14:38.230
Don't act rashly.

14:41.170 --> 14:42.030
I've tested it.

14:42.500 --> 14:43.150
It's safe.

14:45.390 --> 14:46.920
Then let's keep searching.

14:49.590 --> 14:52.010
This should be the Evil God's
ancestral shrine.

14:52.010 --> 14:52.820
I'm guessing

14:53.310 --> 14:55.970
each puppet corresponds to
a corpse-position.

14:58.900 --> 15:00.660
Don't you feel like

15:00.800 --> 15:02.330
something is missing here?

15:08.470 --> 15:10.120
Isn't the size of this gap

15:12.270 --> 15:14.410
exactly the same as that Evil God?

15:19.270 --> 15:21.200
I think maybe...

15:27.470 --> 15:29.310
Did that Evil God statue move just now?

15:29.310 --> 15:30.310
It moved. I saw it.

15:36.130 --> 15:38.660
It seems the crisis
hasn't been resolved yet.

15:38.990 --> 15:39.920
What do we do now?

15:41.960 --> 15:44.020
If you don't want to be killed by them,

15:45.020 --> 15:46.750
we've got to deal with it first.

15:50.670 --> 15:52.230
Don't you think this stone

15:53.200 --> 15:54.530
looks like a human head?

15:54.580 --> 15:55.320
Yeah.

15:55.510 --> 15:56.320
How tall is it?

15:56.430 --> 15:57.250
Not sure.

15:57.360 --> 15:58.610
My guess is

15:58.630 --> 16:00.360
it's at least around 10 meters.

16:01.170 --> 16:02.370
What's on it?

16:02.630 --> 16:03.460
On it?

16:04.290 --> 16:05.700
Let me take a closer look.

16:07.390 --> 16:08.440
It's grass.

16:08.970 --> 16:10.630
Doesn't it look like its hair?

16:12.400 --> 16:13.330
It's green.

16:23.370 --> 16:24.080
Come here!

16:24.450 --> 16:25.310
Come over here!

16:25.610 --> 16:26.320
Come here!

16:27.360 --> 16:28.360
Shrimpie.

16:29.190 --> 16:30.500
We're completely safe now.

16:30.500 --> 16:31.940
What are you doing?

16:32.010 --> 16:33.140
Its eyes

16:33.670 --> 16:35.670
have been completely blinded by me.

16:36.480 --> 16:37.290
Move a bit.

16:38.310 --> 16:39.190
It's safe now.

16:45.950 --> 16:46.720
Alright,

16:47.200 --> 16:48.920
now you put it back.

17:02.670 --> 17:03.230
Shrimpie,

17:03.230 --> 17:04.690
why don't you come with me?

17:05.050 --> 17:05.720
No,

17:07.490 --> 17:08.420
my legs are numb.

17:09.099 --> 17:10.300
What if I die?

17:10.319 --> 17:11.970
Then I'll give you a grand funeral.

17:11.970 --> 17:13.319
That sounds nice.

18:23.310 --> 18:24.980
Sailing underground?

18:26.410 --> 18:27.740
This is not a ship.

18:28.130 --> 18:30.190
It should be a shrine for the Evil God.

18:31.130 --> 18:32.130
Look at that door.

18:32.390 --> 18:33.860
What's enshrined behind it

18:33.860 --> 18:35.790
is probably the Evil God's statue.

18:39.710 --> 18:41.560
Why is this door sealed?

18:42.040 --> 18:42.640
Shrimpie.

18:43.690 --> 18:45.420
Look at these Evil God statues.

18:45.420 --> 18:46.900
They are the same type
as the one from earlier,

18:46.900 --> 18:47.970
but the craftsmanship

18:47.970 --> 18:50.090
seems to come from different regions.

18:50.090 --> 18:50.990
It shows that there are

18:50.990 --> 18:53.320
believers of this Evil God in many places.

18:56.380 --> 18:57.950
The grooves at the base of these statues

18:57.950 --> 18:59.120
are all different.

19:02.680 --> 19:04.140
Do you think it's possible

19:04.430 --> 19:05.950
that the statue is meant to

19:06.530 --> 19:08.060
be inserted into this base,

19:08.910 --> 19:10.760
and by doing so,
the sealed shrine door would open?

19:10.760 --> 19:12.890
This shrine door must never be opened.

20:07.120 --> 20:08.690
If you bring it in here,

20:08.690 --> 20:09.990
we will both die.

20:12.220 --> 20:13.550
There's definitely key evidence

20:13.550 --> 20:15.690
for the case inside that shrine.

20:16.500 --> 20:17.790
If we put it in,

20:17.810 --> 20:19.210
we might be able to see it.

20:20.160 --> 20:21.720
So what do you say—do we put it in or not?

20:21.720 --> 20:22.650
We don't.

20:27.160 --> 20:28.360
Zhang Hailou, you...

21:14.850 --> 21:18.310
Could this be the thing the Evil God
lured people here to dig up?

21:24.820 --> 21:26.420
Don't you think it looks a bit

21:27.070 --> 21:28.130
like the one below?

21:36.230 --> 21:37.630
It's looking at me again.

21:39.600 --> 21:41.290
It's looking at me too.

21:43.630 --> 21:44.760
These two things

21:45.530 --> 21:47.390
seem to belong to the same family.

21:53.060 --> 21:54.060
Here's what we do.

21:55.400 --> 21:56.740
I'll handle the small one,

21:56.740 --> 21:58.470
and you take care of the big one.

21:58.800 --> 21:59.740
I can finish this small one

21:59.740 --> 22:01.180
in 3 seconds.

22:02.290 --> 22:04.150
I'd be finished by it in 3 seconds.

22:07.950 --> 22:08.820
Let's risk it.

22:29.580 --> 22:31.730
The movements and behaviors of
these two things are synchronized.

22:31.730 --> 22:33.100
They can control each other.

22:33.100 --> 22:34.050
What do we do now?

22:43.860 --> 22:44.710
Shrimpie.

22:47.350 --> 22:49.550
Looks like it's time for us to part ways.

22:49.640 --> 22:50.640
If one of us

22:50.860 --> 22:52.520
has to sacrifice themselves,

22:53.450 --> 22:54.500
then let it be me.

22:54.710 --> 22:55.970
You go back to Xiacheng

22:56.430 --> 22:57.560
and find our mentor!

22:58.360 --> 22:59.560
Don't worry about me.

23:00.080 --> 23:00.700
Leave.

23:03.830 --> 23:04.640
Just leave!

23:11.020 --> 23:11.820
You wait here.

23:15.860 --> 23:17.790
There are so many corpses outside.

23:18.860 --> 23:20.520
I'll find one to press it down.

23:26.080 --> 23:27.210
Are you coming back?

23:29.740 --> 23:30.540
Shrimpie!

23:36.670 --> 23:37.870
Remember to come back!

23:37.870 --> 23:39.200
I'll be waiting for you!

24:22.430 --> 24:23.030
Shrimpie!

24:23.180 --> 24:24.100
I've changed my mind!

24:24.100 --> 24:25.830
I'm going back to Xiacheng too!

24:38.230 --> 24:39.040
Where's the Evil God?

24:39.040 --> 24:39.970
Look behind you!

26:33.740 --> 26:34.570
Dead end.

27:12.170 --> 27:13.210
Zhang Ruipu?

27:15.180 --> 27:16.190
Hello, sir.

27:22.260 --> 27:23.410
Who are you two?

27:23.860 --> 27:24.830
We are...

27:29.080 --> 27:29.690
Boys.

27:30.980 --> 27:32.380
What's our stance again?

27:35.570 --> 27:36.500
Just passing by.

27:37.090 --> 27:38.980
We heard there's treasure
being dug up down here,

27:38.980 --> 27:40.130
so we wanted to get a piece of the action.

27:40.130 --> 27:41.650
Judging by your moves just now,

27:41.650 --> 27:43.910
you don't seem like ordinary civilians.

27:44.900 --> 27:46.500
-Actually...
-Actually...

27:47.730 --> 27:48.770
We are bandits.

27:50.410 --> 27:51.810
Probably the same as you.

27:51.840 --> 27:52.250
Yeah.

27:55.560 --> 27:56.270
By the way,

27:57.870 --> 27:59.670
how did you manage to walk in here

27:59.800 --> 28:00.710
alive?

28:01.280 --> 28:01.720
And

28:01.750 --> 28:03.280
what is that thing outside?

28:11.240 --> 28:11.790
You're hiding in here,

28:11.790 --> 28:12.390
yet you don't know?

28:12.390 --> 28:13.620
And you're asking us?

28:17.770 --> 28:19.470
When my men and I came down,

28:20.190 --> 28:21.320
toxic water leaked.

28:21.440 --> 28:22.570
Everyone else died.

28:23.060 --> 28:24.540
After that, we stayed in the corner

28:24.540 --> 28:26.410
waiting for the toxic water to drain.

28:26.410 --> 28:27.210
In the end,

28:27.670 --> 28:29.720
you guys came over with this thing,

28:30.170 --> 28:31.610
so we had to hide again.

28:34.930 --> 28:35.490
The 4 of us

28:35.490 --> 28:37.300
are in the same boat now.

28:38.400 --> 28:39.000
Oh, right.

28:39.230 --> 28:40.360
When we go out later,

28:40.600 --> 28:42.060
we'll split into 2 groups.

28:42.490 --> 28:44.350
The small one is easy to deal with,

28:44.400 --> 28:46.020
while whoever the big one follows

28:46.020 --> 28:46.900
will die.

28:47.640 --> 28:48.540
Let fate decide

28:50.170 --> 28:51.770
what happens to our 2 groups.

28:54.080 --> 28:55.480
No, no, this is not right.

28:55.570 --> 28:56.320
Look.

28:57.100 --> 28:58.060
The two of us

28:58.080 --> 28:59.120
are able-bodied,

28:59.410 --> 29:00.410
but as for you two—

29:00.410 --> 29:01.100
one is old,

29:01.510 --> 29:02.710
and the other is sick.

29:04.010 --> 29:05.270
It should be like this.

29:05.420 --> 29:06.600
You two go out

29:07.240 --> 29:08.360
and split into 2 routes.

29:08.360 --> 29:09.700
That's a 50% chance either way.

29:09.700 --> 29:12.630
We'll take the chance to slip out—
100% success rate.

29:13.610 --> 29:14.810
If you don't agree,

29:16.600 --> 29:18.200
we'll just kick you guys out.

29:21.980 --> 29:23.810
You guys might not know who I am.

29:24.660 --> 29:26.780
I'll cripple one of you first,

29:28.350 --> 29:30.330
then we can talk on equal terms.

29:32.040 --> 29:35.100
Looks like we're going to have to
settle this after all.

30:16.490 --> 30:17.830
With those skills,

30:17.990 --> 30:20.270
you still claim to be ordinary civilians?

30:20.270 --> 30:22.340
We are just skilled civilians.

30:24.060 --> 30:25.620
You're from the South...

30:35.770 --> 30:36.470
Buddy,

30:37.010 --> 30:38.600
are you switching sides?

30:44.790 --> 30:47.120
[Hermit Crab Watch—Token of the Archives]

30:48.760 --> 30:51.070
I'm Zhang Siye
from the Xiacheng Headquarters

30:51.070 --> 30:52.830
[Zhang Siye—Member of
the Southern Archives]

30:51.300 --> 30:53.420
of the Southern Archives.

30:53.520 --> 30:55.540
I've been staying by Zhang Ruipu's side

30:55.540 --> 30:56.900
as an undercover agent.

30:57.660 --> 30:59.910
After Zhang Ruipu failed to seize power
back then,

30:59.910 --> 31:02.990
he fled the Archives to Nanyang

31:03.210 --> 31:05.540
and expanded his influence here.

31:06.100 --> 31:07.760
The Headquarters assigned me

31:07.890 --> 31:09.880
to stay by his side
and keep him under surveillance,

31:09.880 --> 31:11.610
to prevent him from doing evil.

31:13.410 --> 31:14.860
We're from the Balongzhou Branch

31:14.860 --> 31:16.080
of the Southern Archives.

31:16.080 --> 31:17.580
I'm Zhang Hailou, and he's Zhang Haixia.

31:17.580 --> 31:18.410
Since you're from Xiacheng,

31:18.410 --> 31:19.390
do you know...

31:25.270 --> 31:26.690
A few days ago,

31:27.120 --> 31:28.930
he hijacked an official ship

31:29.240 --> 31:30.950
and obtained

31:31.100 --> 31:31.910
a never-before-seen Balinese statue

31:31.910 --> 31:33.800
from a military official.

31:34.930 --> 31:36.520
It came from Xucheng.

31:36.970 --> 31:40.570
Rumor has it that there are
similar Balinese statues in Xucheng.

31:41.280 --> 31:42.880
After obtaining the statue,

31:43.180 --> 31:45.650
Zhang Ruipu started acting
as if he was possessed.

31:45.650 --> 31:47.110
He insisted on coming here

31:47.870 --> 31:49.670
to search for a mysterious cave,

31:50.420 --> 31:53.220
saying he wanted to obtain
some mysterious power.

31:53.890 --> 31:56.860
I assumed there was something wrong
with this Evil God statue,

31:56.860 --> 31:57.800
so

31:57.830 --> 31:59.550
I secretly notified the Headquarters,

31:59.550 --> 32:01.030
hoping colleagues in Nanyang

32:01.030 --> 32:03.960
could assist me in investigating
this Evil God Case.

32:05.530 --> 32:07.600
So you were the one who called us here.

32:09.580 --> 32:10.580
I realized

32:11.560 --> 32:13.290
that the purpose of this statue

32:14.280 --> 32:16.210
is to let something out.

32:22.230 --> 32:24.190
You guys didn't let anything out, did you?

32:24.190 --> 32:24.790
We didn't.

32:29.190 --> 32:30.650
Then what is that outside?

32:32.080 --> 32:32.970
Zhang Ruipu.

32:33.110 --> 32:35.930
Didn't I knock Zhang Ruipu out?

32:38.280 --> 32:39.010
His men.

32:40.210 --> 32:41.210
Here's the thing.

32:41.350 --> 32:44.100
You just said you called us here
to investigate the case...

32:44.100 --> 32:45.500
Stop the investigation.

32:45.930 --> 32:47.940
Also, bear this in mind:

32:48.070 --> 32:49.330
if the Archives

32:49.560 --> 32:51.040
assigns you any more tasks

32:51.210 --> 32:52.360
related to the reef,

32:53.780 --> 32:55.180
you must not accept them.

32:58.150 --> 32:58.720
Why?

32:58.780 --> 32:59.610
Trust me.

33:01.120 --> 33:02.780
Don't investigate anything.

33:03.490 --> 33:04.150
The reef...

33:06.340 --> 33:07.340
And this place...

33:08.160 --> 33:09.220
If you look into it,

33:09.560 --> 33:10.220
you...

33:10.860 --> 33:11.360
You...

33:12.040 --> 33:12.850
You will...

33:13.480 --> 33:13.940
Will...

33:15.170 --> 33:15.630
Will...

33:16.580 --> 33:17.510
So what about...

33:25.210 --> 33:26.150
He's dead?

33:31.080 --> 33:31.600
Grass!

33:32.820 --> 33:33.580
Grass...

33:34.670 --> 33:35.740
Grass...

33:37.750 --> 33:39.080
Grass...

33:44.180 --> 33:44.740
Hey,

33:45.880 --> 33:48.460
why are you still cursing
when you're about to die?

33:48.460 --> 33:49.420
Grass...

33:49.990 --> 33:50.770
Plants...

33:51.230 --> 33:52.040
The reef.

33:54.710 --> 33:55.700
But he's right.

33:55.730 --> 33:57.390
We can't stay here any longer.

33:57.430 --> 33:58.960
Otherwise, we'll both die.

34:01.950 --> 34:03.810
But that thing is still out there.

34:06.140 --> 34:08.139
I just came up with a brilliant plan.

34:58.850 --> 35:00.380
Look at your terrible idea.

35:00.530 --> 35:01.570
What do we do now?

35:02.350 --> 35:03.490
We roll out.

36:25.370 --> 36:26.300
Let's go! Come on.

36:26.300 --> 36:27.250
Who are you two?

36:27.990 --> 36:29.030
Zhang Ruipu is dying,

36:29.030 --> 36:30.020
and you're asking who I am?

36:30.020 --> 36:31.320
Where are the explosives? Bring them here!

36:31.320 --> 36:32.410
We have to blow up the entrance

36:32.410 --> 36:33.160
to save him!

36:33.180 --> 36:34.700
Didn't you just climb up
from the entrance?

36:34.700 --> 36:35.850
Why do we still need to blow it up?

36:35.850 --> 36:37.450
You're asking me why?

36:37.540 --> 36:38.540
Good question!

36:39.970 --> 36:40.640
Because I am

36:40.640 --> 36:41.660
lying through my teeth!

36:41.660 --> 36:42.280
Run!

37:13.810 --> 37:14.310
Here.

37:16.370 --> 37:17.630
What do we do now?

37:18.830 --> 37:20.090
Isn't the case closed?

37:20.990 --> 37:22.450
The Evil God's ancestral shrine
has been blown up.

37:22.450 --> 37:24.110
No one will die there anymore.

37:24.660 --> 37:26.520
We solved a major case in Nanyang.

37:27.390 --> 37:29.620
We'll definitely become regular agents.

37:29.620 --> 37:31.740
The Evil God's ancestral shrine
is sealed off now,

37:31.740 --> 37:33.540
but the case can't be closed yet.

37:33.660 --> 37:35.720
How am I supposed to write the report?

37:36.260 --> 37:37.210
What report?

37:39.620 --> 37:41.620
The report to our mentor, of course.

37:43.940 --> 37:45.520
Just write that it was my fault
that the Evil God's ancestral shrine

37:45.520 --> 37:46.140
had been blown to pieces.

37:46.140 --> 37:48.060
But I also took care of the Evil God.

37:48.060 --> 37:49.170
Make me sound cool.

37:50.560 --> 37:51.490
You know every report

37:51.490 --> 37:52.870
has to be checked
for logical consistency, right?

37:52.870 --> 37:53.870
If other agents

37:53.900 --> 37:55.680
are somehow connected to our case,

37:55.680 --> 37:57.030
the Archives will be able to

37:57.030 --> 37:58.530
link everything together.

37:58.530 --> 37:59.200
So for this report,

37:59.200 --> 38:00.140
I can only write

38:00.850 --> 38:02.380
that the leads were cut off.

38:02.990 --> 38:04.380
How were the leads cut off?

38:04.380 --> 38:05.600
Didn't that advisor say

38:05.600 --> 38:07.730
the Evil God statue came from Xucheng?

38:08.930 --> 38:10.100
How is that lead any different
from saying this fish

38:10.100 --> 38:11.570
came from this lake?

38:12.040 --> 38:15.240
Do you know how many Evil God statues
are there in Xucheng?

38:17.370 --> 38:20.030
Zhang Haixia, I think you're just
targeting me.

38:20.760 --> 38:22.480
You know I blew up that place

38:23.120 --> 38:24.470
for my own reasons.

38:24.580 --> 38:25.490
If I had a choice,

38:25.490 --> 38:27.490
I absolutely wouldn't have done it.

38:27.600 --> 38:28.640
I think you're just blaming me

38:28.640 --> 38:29.850
for getting you stuck in Nanyang.

38:29.850 --> 38:31.760
Zhang Hailou, do you even
have a conscience?

38:31.760 --> 38:33.640
We were doing just fine in Xiacheng.

38:33.640 --> 38:35.280
Who's the one that got fooled by Mentor

38:35.280 --> 38:38.010
into coming to Nanyang
for a 30-year assignment?

38:38.310 --> 38:40.310
Do you even know how long 30 years is?

38:41.680 --> 38:46.990
[6 months ago, Xiacheng]

38:42.100 --> 38:43.360
Did Mentor talk to you?

38:43.430 --> 38:44.760
Where did you choose to go?

38:44.760 --> 38:45.490
I forgot

38:45.600 --> 38:46.400
where I chose.

38:46.580 --> 38:48.040
Where did you choose to go?

38:48.870 --> 38:50.910
Probably the Thirteen Hongs of Guangchuan.

38:50.910 --> 38:51.960
Not bad.

38:52.240 --> 38:53.370
That's a cushy post.

38:53.790 --> 38:54.650
I remember now.

38:55.300 --> 38:57.570
The place I'm going to
seems to be called...

38:57.570 --> 38:58.470
Balongzhou.

39:03.080 --> 39:03.930
What?

39:05.930 --> 39:07.190
You're going to Balai?

39:07.680 --> 39:08.880
-What's wrong?
-You…

39:10.350 --> 39:11.850
Do you know that
agents who go to Balongzhou

39:11.850 --> 39:13.290
never come back alive?

39:16.120 --> 39:17.020
Seriously?

39:17.050 --> 39:17.860
You, oh you.

39:18.040 --> 39:19.450
You got fooled by Mentor again...

39:19.450 --> 39:20.510
Alright.

39:20.930 --> 39:22.330
Someone has to go anyway.

39:22.790 --> 39:23.920
Mentor letting me go

39:24.410 --> 39:25.560
means she trusts me.

39:26.990 --> 39:27.870
Maybe

39:28.910 --> 39:30.370
I'll become the only agent

39:30.390 --> 39:32.100
to come back from Balongzhou.

39:35.160 --> 39:36.090
Wherever you go.

39:36.760 --> 39:37.710
Anyway, we won't be

39:37.710 --> 39:39.450
handling cases together anymore.

39:39.450 --> 39:42.180
As for whether
you can come back from Balongzhou,

39:43.100 --> 39:44.630
it has nothing to do with me.

39:44.810 --> 39:45.740
What do you mean?

39:46.410 --> 39:46.950
Hey, Zhang,

39:46.950 --> 39:48.370
are you breaking off our friendship
or something?

39:48.370 --> 39:48.970
Come back!

39:50.180 --> 39:53.890
[Xiacheng]

40:03.630 --> 40:04.930
[Baggage and Cargo Area]

40:09.250 --> 40:10.710
This is the ship to Balongzhou.

40:10.710 --> 40:12.870
Weren't you going to
the Thirteen Hongs of Guangchuan?

40:12.870 --> 40:13.850
Got the wrong ship?

40:13.850 --> 40:15.520
I applied to change locations.

40:15.520 --> 40:17.670
Working abroad pays well.

40:18.530 --> 40:19.230
Come on.

40:19.370 --> 40:19.950
I think

40:19.950 --> 40:21.150
you were just worried

40:21.260 --> 40:22.830
I'd be going to Balongzhou all alone,
right?

40:22.830 --> 40:23.580
Cut it out.

40:27.240 --> 40:28.700
Be more careful, will you?

40:28.870 --> 40:29.850
We're heading to

40:29.850 --> 40:31.460
a godforsaken place,

40:31.660 --> 40:33.720
and we have to stay there for 30 years.

40:33.720 --> 40:35.510
If we sneak back to Xiacheng
halfway through,

40:35.510 --> 40:36.830
we'll face severe punishment—

40:36.830 --> 40:38.130
even imprisonment.

40:41.430 --> 40:42.360
Thirty years...

40:43.890 --> 40:45.560
Isn't that over in the blink of an eye?

40:45.560 --> 40:46.140
Relax.

40:46.490 --> 40:47.580
Stick with me.

40:47.630 --> 40:49.890
We'll make a name for ourselves
in Balongzhou.

40:49.890 --> 40:51.680
When the time comes,
we'll return to Xiacheng in glory

40:51.680 --> 40:53.390
and see Mentor together. Let's go.

40:53.390 --> 40:54.250
Board the ship!

40:55.570 --> 40:56.580
Balongzhou,

40:56.990 --> 40:57.760
here we come!

41:02.830 --> 41:04.260
But we could sneak back.

41:04.310 --> 41:06.230
We signed and left our fingerprints.

41:06.230 --> 41:07.490
We're going straight to jail
if we sneak back.

41:07.490 --> 41:07.950
Enough.

41:08.680 --> 41:09.480
I'm not happy.

41:09.930 --> 41:10.240
I quit!

41:10.240 --> 41:11.470
Every time we talk about this,

41:11.470 --> 41:12.470
you get like this.

41:12.560 --> 41:14.080
Let's sit down and talk it through, okay?

41:14.080 --> 41:14.550
What did you say?

41:14.550 --> 41:15.480
I can't hear you!

41:15.510 --> 41:17.560
I said you're a good-for-nothing!

41:17.560 --> 41:18.990
You said you're a good-for-nothing?

41:18.050 --> 41:19.850
♪ The answers come in a rush,
the harbor's wrapped in mist ♪

41:18.990 --> 41:19.640
Got it!

41:20.280 --> 41:22.440
♪ One punch is a joke,
the next one is the real deal ♪

41:20.410 --> 41:21.470
See you in Xucheng!

41:23.000 --> 41:23.810
♪ We may not be partners ♪

41:24.530 --> 41:25.560
♪ Just travelers sharing
the same stretch of road ♪

41:26.240 --> 41:27.930
♪ Through bloodstorms and chaos,
life's still worth the walk ♪

41:28.780 --> 41:29.870
♪ In this joking jianghu,
the blood is real ♪

41:30.480 --> 41:32.870
♪ Another page turns in the archives,
the fog blurs every boundary ♪

41:33.570 --> 41:34.620
♪ Yet he sees it crystal clear,
the moment his lips curl crooked ♪

41:35.240 --> 41:36.020
♪ Another case is solved ♪

41:36.580 --> 41:38.030
♪ Smiling like crescent moon
after crescent moon ♪

41:38.600 --> 41:39.370
♪ When gunfire replaces wisecracks ♪

41:39.860 --> 41:40.700
♪ That's when you learn the code
hidden in his eyes ♪

41:41.400 --> 41:41.960
♪ Who swiped my coffee? ♪

41:42.450 --> 41:43.350
♪ Time for me to blow the whistle
on somebody ♪

41:43.760 --> 41:44.720
Don't play this game with me.

41:43.770 --> 41:44.440
♪ You speak another heartfelt truth ♪

41:45.070 --> 41:46.010
♪ I'll answer with another joke ♪

41:46.440 --> 41:48.140
♪ This place runs on gunpowder,
not perfume ♪

41:46.530 --> 41:47.930
I don't think I was wrong.

41:48.850 --> 41:50.960
♪ Who's afraid of whom?
The ship's already sunk before, anyway ♪

41:51.490 --> 41:53.260
♪ What the archives can never fully
record is the silence of ordinary people ♪

41:52.010 --> 41:52.680
Right.

41:53.240 --> 41:54.540
How could you ever be wrong?

41:54.210 --> 41:55.940
♪ When the laughter fades away,
only the truth remains burning ♪

41:56.100 --> 41:57.860
Do you think
I haven't learned your tricks?

41:56.450 --> 41:57.170
♪ Welcome to Nanyang ♪

41:57.650 --> 41:58.790
♪ The swift ship of justice ♪

41:58.490 --> 41:59.310
I have.

41:59.300 --> 42:00.960
♪ Hey there, hey there, sweet hey there ♪

41:59.740 --> 42:01.080
Every time I take a risk,

42:01.080 --> 42:02.580
it's because I really have no choice.

42:01.300 --> 42:03.780
♪ Hey there, hey there, sweet hey there ♪

42:03.720 --> 42:04.760
If I had a choice,

42:04.490 --> 42:05.420
♪ With harmony we make our way
through the world ♪

42:04.760 --> 42:06.470
I'd be a very meticulous person.

42:05.920 --> 42:06.720
♪ Or lose an arm in the name of justice ♪

42:07.170 --> 42:08.580
♪ Breaking through the maze,
I still dare to carry on ♪

42:08.910 --> 42:09.800
Bro.

42:09.240 --> 42:11.320
♪ Hey there, hey there, sweet hey there ♪

42:10.430 --> 42:11.850
It's not that you take risks—

42:11.550 --> 42:13.800
♪ Hey there, hey there, sweet hey there ♪

42:14.180 --> 42:15.710
it's that you actually feel thrilled

42:14.430 --> 42:15.360
♪ With harmony we make our way
through the world ♪

42:15.760 --> 42:16.670
♪ Or lose an arm in the name of justice ♪

42:16.140 --> 42:17.850
when you take risks.

42:17.180 --> 42:18.620
♪ Breaking through the maze,
I still dare to carry on ♪

42:19.540 --> 42:20.470
That's fatal.

42:19.650 --> 42:21.350
♪ Hanging by a thread,
this one won't retreat a single step ♪

42:20.920 --> 42:21.280
Darn it.

42:21.280 --> 42:22.020
You can tell?

42:22.000 --> 42:23.850
♪ You once said we'd live on,
does that promise still count? ♪

42:23.520 --> 42:24.820
My name is Zhang Haixia,

42:24.380 --> 42:26.450
♪ If this is a gamble,
put your life in my hands ♪

42:25.310 --> 42:27.310
not "Zhang Haixia the blind", okay?

42:27.510 --> 42:29.170
Just for the sake of argument,

42:29.760 --> 42:32.090
feeling thrilled is my personal freedom,

42:32.100 --> 42:32.660
right?

42:35.890 --> 42:38.950
Then have you ever thought about
the people around you?

42:39.370 --> 42:40.500
You get your thrill,

42:41.490 --> 42:43.150
but what about everyone else?

42:44.620 --> 42:46.500
Not everyone is as good as you.

42:47.060 --> 42:49.190
Some people can't handle the fallout.

42:50.540 --> 42:51.740
But since childhood,

42:52.560 --> 42:55.020
haven't you and Mentor both
handled it well?

42:56.350 --> 42:58.000
♪ Hey there, hey there, sweet hey there ♪

42:57.030 --> 42:57.950
So stubborn.

42:58.430 --> 43:00.830
♪ Hey there, hey there, sweet hey there ♪

42:58.920 --> 43:01.540
-You'll drag me down sooner or later.
-Where's the carriage?

43:01.540 --> 43:02.460
♪ With harmony we make our way
through the world ♪

43:01.950 --> 43:02.720
It left.

43:02.920 --> 43:03.520
♪ Or lose an arm in the name of justice ♪

43:04.220 --> 43:05.630
♪ Breaking through the maze,
I still dare to carry on ♪

43:04.330 --> 43:06.280
It left? So we have to walk back?

43:06.290 --> 43:07.850
♪ Hey there, hey there, sweet hey there ♪

43:06.970 --> 43:09.180
Just think of it as your punishment.

43:08.580 --> 43:10.830
♪ Hey there, hey there, sweet hey there ♪

43:10.800 --> 43:12.630
Fine, I've got my punishment.
But what about you?

43:11.480 --> 43:12.290
♪ With harmony we make our way
through the world ♪

43:12.810 --> 43:13.580
♪ Or lose an arm in the name of justice ♪

43:13.200 --> 43:14.890
I always end up getting dragged down
by you.

43:14.230 --> 43:15.670
♪ Breaking through the maze,
I still dare to carry on ♪

43:15.570 --> 43:16.370
Let me ask you.

43:16.600 --> 43:18.010
♪ Waters in the east,
bandits in the west ♪

43:17.600 --> 43:18.810
Take this case for example.

43:18.810 --> 43:20.220
Tell me what the right way
to handle it is.

43:18.820 --> 43:19.450
♪ The Archives' story goes on ♪

43:20.430 --> 43:20.940
♪ Moving day by day ♪

43:21.690 --> 43:22.470
Tell me about it.

43:21.710 --> 43:23.160
♪ With the sky overhead,
mountains and seas back to back ♪

43:22.500 --> 43:24.030
I'll try to be more like that, okay?

43:23.870 --> 43:25.700
♪ In this tale of the South,
who's the coward now? ♪

43:24.940 --> 43:26.960
For example, you could investigate
the Evil God,

43:26.790 --> 43:28.210
♪ Waters in the east,
bandits in the west ♪

43:26.990 --> 43:28.890
but you shouldn't have touched
that Evil God statue.

43:28.890 --> 43:29.650
♪ The Archives' story goes on ♪

43:28.930 --> 43:30.500
Well, I didn't have a hammer, bro.

43:30.390 --> 43:31.100
♪ Moving day by day ♪

43:30.530 --> 43:31.530
Speaking of which, you shouldn't

43:31.530 --> 43:33.500
have used the Evil God statue
as a hammer.

43:31.860 --> 43:33.360
♪ Hey there, hey there, sweet hey there ♪

43:33.820 --> 43:35.090
If I didn't use the Evil God as a hammer,

43:33.940 --> 43:36.330
♪ Hey there, hey there, sweet hey there ♪

43:35.120 --> 43:36.360
should I have used you instead?

43:36.360 --> 43:37.720
Should I have smashed you?

43:37.720 --> 43:38.710
Seriously.

43:40.740 --> 43:41.450
Hurry up.

43:41.470 --> 43:43.270
We still need to go to Xucheng
to investigate the Evil God.
